11632	// os.Stat/filepath.EvalSymlinks is not enough: a same-volume local symlink or
11633	// junction can itself point at a second symlink that names a UNC share, and
11634	// the kernel's own symlink-following inside that one Stat/EvalSymlinks call
11635	// resolves EVERY hop to satisfy its own answer — including the second one —
11636	// before this function's caller ever sees that an intermediate hop existed.
